<title>USA: TENNIS-MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEMPHIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tennessee 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result from the</p>
<p>$825,000 St Jude men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix</p>
<p>number denote seeding):</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 8-Todd Woodbridge (Australia)</p>
<p>beat 13-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
